o individual who is serving in an office listed \nin section 1(a)–(f) of this order in an acting capacity shall, by virtue of \nso serving, act as Director pursuant to this order.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"90 FR 2587, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 2(a)","sha256":"204d4efa1945e6048b6c7fa9945920ffc18adf344ec55713a5651dfd795aa15a","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-01-13/pdf/2025-00620.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14139#sec2(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) No individual who is serving in an office listed in section 1(a)– \n(f) of this order shall act as Director unless that individual is otherwise \neligible to so serve under the Act.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"90 FR 2587, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 2(b)","sha256":"204d4efa1945e6048b6c7fa9945920ffc18adf344ec55713a5651dfd795aa15a","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-01-13/pdf/2025-00620.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14139#sec2(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(c) Notwithstanding the provisions of this order, the President retains \ndiscretion, to the extent permitted by law, to depart from this order in \ndesignating an acting Director.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"90 FR 2587, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 2(c)","sha256":"204d4efa1945e6048b6c7fa9945920ffc18adf344ec55713a5651dfd795aa15a","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-01-13/pdf/2025-00620.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14139#sec2(c)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) Nothing in this order shall be construed \nto impair or otherwise affect: \n(i) the authority granted by law to an executive department or agency, \nor the head thereof; or \n(ii) the functions of the Director of the Office of Management and Budget \nrelating to budgetary, administrative, or legislative proposals.","original_source":{"pa